 "remarks": "Discover this inviting Pemberwick home offering exceptional space, versatility, and convenience! Featuring 4 bedrooms-one on the main level and three upstairs, including a flexible two-room bedroom suite-plus 3 full baths, generous closets and storage, main-level laundry, and new appliances. The finished walk-out lower level with kitchenette and full bath offers even more possibilities for guests, a home office, recreation, or multigenerational living. Enjoy a spacious deck, large fully fenced backyard, and garage. Located in the Glenville School district, minutes from Pemberwick Park and playground, with easy access to downtown Greenwich, Metro-North, shops, dining, beaches, parks, marina, ferry, and town pool.",
